---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
import portrait from '../assets/images/portrait.jpg';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Shivam Birmole: a founder-minded builder with four years of data engineering at TresVista, a computer engineering degree, and products built while studying at Masters' Union."
>
  <header class="page-head">
    <h1>Four years of data, a family hospital, and now products.</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="about">
    <div class="about__text">
      <p>
        I'm Shivam. I think like a founder: I look for a problem worth fixing, and then I build until there is
        something people can use. I'm from a family that works in healthcare, which is where I first saw how much of
        a place runs on systems nobody designed.
      </p>
      <p>
        I studied computer engineering at NMIMS in Mumbai, then spent four years at TresVista in Pune as a data
        engineer. The job was to take data that arrived messy, from vendors, banks and fund managers, and turn it
        into something a person could rely on to make a decision.
      </p>
      <p>
        That habit carried into what I build now. MedDraft takes a doctor's spoken notes and gives them a structure a
        doctor can check. MU Central takes what scrolls past in a campus group chat and gives it a place. The data work
        and the products are the same instinct, pointed at different problems.
      </p>
      <p>
        In college I chaired the NM Debate Society. Debate is where I learned to lay a problem out in columns before
        arguing about it, which is why this site looks the way it does.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm now in the Post Graduate Programme in Technology & Business Management at Masters' Union, and I am still
        building.
      </p>
      <p><a class="go" href="/work/">See the work <Arrow /></a></p>
    </div>
    <figure class="photo">
      <Image
        src={portrait}
        alt="Shivam Birmole, bearded, in a light grey suit, standing with his hands clasped and smiling."
        widths={[400, 800]}
        sizes="(min-width: 60rem) 26rem, 92vw"
        loading="eager"
      />
      <figcaption>The one photo of me in a suit.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="line-title">
    <h2 id="line-title">Most recent first.</h2>
    <ol class="line">
      <li>
        <span class="when">2026 on</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Masters' Union</strong>
          <span class="what">Post Graduate Programme in Technology & Business Management.</span>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="when">May 2025</span>
        <div><strong>Databricks Certified Data Engineer Associate</strong><span class="what">Earned May 2025.</span></div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="when">2022 to 2026</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Associate, TresVista Analytics LLP</strong>
          <span class="what">Data engineering and analytics, Pune. June 2022 to April 2026.</span>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="when">2018 to 2022</span>
        <div>
          <strong>B.Tech, Computer Engineering</strong>
          <span class="what">NMIMS, Mukesh Patel School of Technology Management & Engineering.</span>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="when">2018</span>
        <div><strong>Café 101, Kankavli</strong><span class="what">Started, funded and ran it after Class XII.</span></div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="more-title">
    <h2 id="more-title">Rooms I have run, and tools I use.</h2>
    <div class="two-col" style="margin-top: var(--space-6)">
      <div>
        <h3>Organising</h3>
        <ol class="line">
          <li>
            <span class="when">2022</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Chairperson, NM Debate Society</strong>
              <span class="what">Organised and led activities for a society of more than 200 debaters.</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="when">2021</span>
            <div><strong>Media Executive, NMMUN Summit</strong></div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="when">2020 to 2021</span>
            <div><strong>CR & Hospitality Executive, YSF</strong></div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="when">Also</span>
            <div><strong>Volunteering</strong><span class="what">Coastal clean-ups and career counselling.</span></div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Tools</h3>
        <ol class="line">
          <li>
            <span class="when">Data</span>
            <div>Python, PySpark, SQL, Databricks, Apache Airflow</div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="when">Cloud</span>
            <div>Azure, AWS S3, SQL Server</div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="when">Reporting</span>
            <div>Power BI, Power Automate</div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="when">Products</span>
            <div>Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind, Supabase</div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
